  Notation ZL pc mm r1 r5 r6 r7 r8 r11 r14 r15 r16 r17 r21 r22 r25 r26 r28 r29 r30 r31 :=
    (ZS pc mm r1 r5 r6 r7 r8 y9 y10 r11 y12 y13 r14 r15 r16 r17 y18 y19 (Z_to_bv 64 (SS + O)) r21 r22 y23
        (Z_to_bv 64 (tl + 256 * mtl)) r25 r26 (Z_to_bv 64 2147450880) r28 r29 r30 r31) (only parsing).

